{"id":"wb-7-1307","name":"白玉嘎托寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"嘎拖寺","text":"嘎拖寺（藏语：ཀཿ་ཐོག་རྡོ་རྗེ་གདན་，THL：Katok Dorjé Den，又译噶陀寺、噶妥寺、嘎托寺、呷拖寺、嘎多寺、嘎陀寺等）位于四川省白玉县，是中国藏传佛教宁玛派六大寺院之一。\n2004年增补为第六批四川省文物保护单位，2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%98%8E%E6%8B%96%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93283797,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93283797","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bfbae27148e9be8414e76174.jpg","title":"Katok_Monastery.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Katok_Monastery.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Katok_Monastery.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"NoGhost","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Katok Monastery in 2014","width":320,"height":240}}